description: Telegram and STT/Whisper integration rules
globs: "integrations/**/*"
alwaysApply: false
---

# Integrations (Telegram + STT)

- Handlers are I/O only; call `core.services` for persistence
- Text and voice share the same ingest semantics after transcription
- `STT_PROVIDER=stub` for local/tests; `whisper` needs `OPENAI_API_KEY`
- On STT failure: ask user to resend as text; do not drop the project state
- Never log full bot tokens or raw secrets
- Keep aiogram/ equests isolated in `integrations/telegram`
- Whisper client stays in `integrations/stt`; no OpenAI calls from routers
